    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d317-a5">

                <pb facs="0433" n="325" sameAs="frus:frus1893/pg325"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 5 in No. 25.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Deposition of Tern Macke.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Royalist</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic">Tarawa
                            Island</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1893-07-15"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">July 15,
                    1893</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Tem Macke, a native of Tarawa, having been cautioned to speak the truth, said: I
                    know Jacob. About one year and a half ago I saw Eno burn Jacob’s house down.</p>
                <p>It was done because Jacob did not work in Kustel’s ship, I think. I was by myself
                    at the time. I did not tell anyone about what I saw.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Tem
                            Macke.</hi></signed><lb/>Witnesses:<lb/><signed><hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">S. Beaumont</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Lieutenant.</hi></signed><lb/><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >Tekiatowa</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Interpreter.</hi></signed><lb/><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >Duncan S. O. Grant</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic">Assistant
                            Paymaster.</hi></signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Before me:</p>
                    <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Ed. H. M. Davis</hi>,<lb/><hi
                                rendition="#italic">Captain and Deputy
                        Commissioner.</hi></signed></closer>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
